# Staffordshire Chambers Room Hire

A lightweight booking tool for Staffordshire Chambers to visualise and manage all meeting spaces.

## Getting started

1. Open `index.html` in a modern web browser (Chrome, Edge, Firefox or Safari).
2. The application stores bookings in your browser's local storage so your data persists between visits on the same device.

## Features

- Branded interface using Staffordshire Chambers colours and logo.
- Mini calendar for quickly jumping between dates.
- Daily room overview with a timeline view for all rooms simultaneously.
- Booking form supporting multiple rooms, half-hour increments and longer sessions.
- Track attendee counts, preferred room layouts, equipment, refreshments and lunch requirements.
- Edit or delete existing bookings directly from the timeline.

## Notes

- Bookings must be at least 30 minutes long.
- Overlapping bookings in the same room are prevented automatically.
- To clear all saved bookings, clear your browser storage for this site.
